<title>USA: Allied Capital Lending sets year-end div.</title>
<headline>Allied Capital Lending sets year-end div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Capital Lending Corp Tuesday declared a year end dividend of $0.08 a share, payable January 31 to shareholders of record December 27.</p>
<p>The dividend is in addition to the company's regular quarterly dividend of $0.32 a share to be paid December 31.</p>
<p>The year-end payment raises the REIT's 1996 distributions to $1.30 per share, it said. That compares with $1.22 per share in 1995 and $1.08 per share in 1994, the trust said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
